{"seq":2,"slug":"node-factory","title":"NodeFactory 节点创建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript-compiler-api/transformers/node-factory","wordCount":485,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"nodefactory-节点创建\">NodeFactory 节点创建</h1><p>当 Transformer 需要替换或新增 AST 节点时，你不能直接修改现有节点——TypeScript 的 AST 是不可变的。所有新节点的构造都通过 <code>NodeFactory</code> 完成，它提供了与每种 <code>SyntaxKind</code> 对应的 <code>createXxx</code> 和 <code>updateXxx</code> 工厂方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>NodeFactory 遵循两个设计原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>create vs update</strong>：<code>createXxx</code> 从零构建新节点；<code>updateXxx</code> 基于已有节点创建副本并替换部分子节点（保留原始位置信息和 trivia）。</li>\n<li><strong>结构正确性由调用者负责</strong>：Factory 不做语义检查——你可以构造出类型错误的 AST。确保结构合法是你的责任。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph NodeFactory API&#10;        C[createXxx] --&gt; N[全新节点]&#10;        U[updateXxx] --&gt; M[保留位置的副本]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 使用场景&#10;        N --&gt; R[替换/新增]&#10;        M --&gt; P[修改部分子节点]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph NodeFactory API\n        C[createXxx] --&gt; N[全新节点]\n        U[updateXxx] --&gt; M[保留位置的副本]\n    end\n    subgraph 使用场景\n        N --&gt; R[替换/新增]\n        M --&gt; P[修改部分子节点]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法前缀</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>位置信息</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>createXxx</code></td>\n<td>从零构建</td>\n<td>无位置（synthetic）</td>\n<td>注入新代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>updateXxx</code></td>\n<td>副本 + 部分替换</td>\n<td>继承原节点位置</td>\n<td>修改已有代码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"获取-factory-实例\">获取 Factory 实例</h2><p>在 TypeScript 5.x 中，Factory 有两种获取方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 方式一：在 Transformer 内通过 context&#10;const transformer: ts.TransformerFactory&lt;ts.SourceFile&gt; = (context) =&gt; {&#10;  const factory = context.factory;&#10;  // ...&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 方式二：全局 ts.factory（TypeScript 4.0+ 始终可用）&#10;const node = ts.factory.createIdentifier(&#39;myVar&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方式一：在 Transformer 内通过 context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transformer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TransformerFactory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SourceFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> factory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context.factory;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方式二：全局 ts.factory（TypeScript 4.0+ 始终可用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.factory.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createIdentifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'myVar'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>建议在 Transformer 内始终使用 <code>context.factory</code>——它可能包含版本特定的增强行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基本值节点创建\">基本值节点创建</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const { factory } = context;&#10;&#10;// 标识符&#10;const id = factory.createIdentifier(&#39;myVariable&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 字面量&#10;const strLit = factory.createStringLiteral(&#39;hello&#39;);&#10;const numLit = factory.createNumericLiteral(&#39;42&#39;);&#10;const boolLit = factory.createTrue(); // 或 createFalse()&#10;const nullLit = factory.createNull();&#10;&#10;// 模板字面量&#10;const template = factory.createTemplateExpression(factory.createTemplateHead(&#39;Hello, &#39;), [&#10;  factory.createTemplateSpan(factory.createIdentifier(&#39;name&#39;), factory.createTemplateTail(&#39;!&#39;)),&#10;]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">factory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 标识符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> factory.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createIdentifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'myVariable'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 字面量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> strLit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> factory.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createStringLiteral</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> numLit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> factory.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createNumericLiteral</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'42'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolLit</span><span s